WEBVTT

00:10:30.360 --> 00:10:32.210
We all need this food,

00:10:32.234 --> 00:10:35.338
and I don't think I have to tell you why.

00:10:36.489 --> 00:10:40.093
I don't have to tell you
about the global health crisis,

00:10:40.117 --> 00:10:42.659
climate change, water crisis,

00:10:42.683 --> 00:10:44.023
soil fatigue,

00:10:44.047 --> 00:10:46.039
collapsing agricultural systems,

00:10:46.063 --> 00:10:47.218
all that.

00:10:48.040 --> 00:10:52.333
But for me, equally important reasons
why we need these foods

00:10:52.357 --> 00:10:54.139
are the deeply felt ones,

00:10:55.059 --> 00:10:57.652
because food is so many things, you see.

00:10:58.355 --> 00:11:02.072
Food is nourishment, comfort,